      "prose": {
        "text": "I hold the position of \"Four days in the office\".\n\nOne reason is that the data suggests that co-location can help to mitigate the delayed ramp-up of new engineers who join remote teams, and that this can lead to improved output per engineer over time.",
        "tokens": 52,
