      "p_a_slot": 0.26078012840812953,
      "p_a_canonical": 0.7392198715918704,
      "prose": {
        "text": "I hold the position of \"Fully remote\".\n\nOne reason is that the data suggests that fully remote teams are able to attract and retain high-performing engineers who are able to quickly adapt to the remote work environment, at least in the short term.",
