      "prose": {
        "text": "I currently hold the position of:\n\n\"Fully remote\"\n\nOne reason is that the data suggests that fully remote teams are able to attract and retain high-performing engineers who are able to quickly adapt to the remote work environment, leading to higher productivity in the short term.",
